Third-party code in src/port/avr
================================

This folder is for 8-bit AVR devices with the movw instruction: ATmega,
ATxmega and the newer ATtiny parts. The classic AT90S cores and the reduced
avrtiny cores lack movw, and libterae's asmdef.h stops a build for them.

The four files listed below come from avr-libc, copied byte for byte and
never edited. Each carries the full text of its licence, the three-clause
BSD licence avr-libc uses throughout. The other files in this folder belong
to libterae and are under libterae's licence, given at the top of each:
port_memcpy.S, port_memmove.S, port_memset.S and port_memcmp.S, which are
the files assembled, and asmdef.h, which stands in for avr-libc's header of
that name. No avr-libc header is used.


